cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Quantum Repeater Digital Twin: Machine Learning-Based RUC Estimation and Predictive Optimization"
message: "If you use this software, simulations, models, or results in academic work, please cite this repository."
type: software

authors:

* family-names: "Santos"
  given-names: "Alexandre Oliveira Silva"
