version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-08-06"

abstract: >
A research software framework for the simulation and intelligent control
of quantum repeater networks using digital twin technology, machine
learning, quantum-channel modeling, and predictive optimization.
The framework integrates synthetic WDM telemetry, quantum noise models,
Edge AI prediction, adaptive repeater control, multi-objective Pareto
optimization, and performance evaluation for quantum networking scenarios.

